Package: hmmTradeR
Type: Package
Title: Hidden Markov Model Tools for Quantitative Trading
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Serge", "Moisan",
           email = "serge.moisan@yahoo.fr",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides high-performance tools for Hidden Markov Models (HMM) 
    applied to financial time series. The package implements EM algorithms, 
    Viterbi decoding, and Forward filtering in C++ for maximum speed. 
    Includes backtesting frameworks, online learning capabilities, 
    and risk management modules specifically designed for stock price modeling.
